For your interview preparation, learn these in this order

Level 1 — LLM basics

Tokens → Context Window → Prompt → Temperature → Streaming → Tool Calling

↓

Level 2 — RAG

Documents → Parsing → Chunks → Embeddings → Vector DB → Similarity Search

↓

Level 3 — Better RAG

Metadata → Hybrid Search → Reranking → Query Rewriting → Citations → Evaluation

↓

Level 4 — Frameworks

LangChain → LangGraph → Agents → Memory → Tools

↓

Level 5 — Production

Caching → Redis → Queues → Async Workers → Rate Limiting → Monitoring → Security → Scaling

For your level, I would especially prepare questions 3, 5, 7, 8, 9, 12, 13, 18, 19 and 20 because those can turn into deeper follow-up questions in a Full-Stack + AI interview.
